    "commit": "521962e00",
    "summary": "A third review round against 38933ec4c found one more P2: the serialization lock key used repoPath verbatim, so two spellings of the same repository (e.g. a trailing slash) acquired different locks while updating the same receipt file, reopening the same race the prior serialization fix closed. Canonicalized repoPath with resolve+realpathSync before it enters the lock key, matching the canonicalization daemon/lifecycle-registry.ts already uses for the identical reason. Added a concurrent-append test using repo and `${repo}/`; confirmed it fails without the fix (the aliased receipt is dropped) before restoring it."
  },
